// Installed by proxmox-autoupdate.
//
// A pve-manager upgrade replaces /usr/share/pve-manager/js/pvemanagerlib.js
// wholesale, which removes the Auto-Update toolbar button. This hook re-applies
// it afterwards.
//
// This fires after *every* dpkg transaction, not only pve-manager upgrades, so
// `apply` is a no-op unless the exact expected block is missing: it greps for a
// fingerprint of the block it would write and returns immediately if it is
// already there. Only when the block is absent or stale does it rewrite the
// file, and that rewrite stages to a temporary file in the same directory and
// finishes with an atomic rename, so an interrupted run can never leave a
// truncated pvemanagerlib.js behind.
DPkg::Post-Invoke {
    "if [ -x /usr/local/bin/pve-autoupdate-patch-webui ]; then /usr/local/bin/pve-autoupdate-patch-webui apply --quiet >/dev/null 2>&1 || true; fi";
};
